stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Charging: at the tower's centre
    Charging --> Charged: full (charge time, Meteor)
    Charged --> Flight: an enemy in range (no lead)
    Flight --> Flight: hits each enemy its body touches (Meteor)
    Flight --> Impact: reaches the aim spot
    Impact --> Fire: black fill gone - grows to its max (Hellfire)
    Impact --> Pellets: fly out, passing through (Blk Magic)
    Impact --> Giant: Mega Firaga - one giant flare
    Fire --> Fire: burns what stands in it, many small ticks
    Fire --> [*]: lingers, then fades
    Pellets --> Flare: one where each lands
    Flare --> [*]: burns, brighter the harder it hits
    Giant --> [*]
    Charged --> Charging: launched
